## Interface: 16001
## Title: Patchwerk Forever: Thread (Sparkle)
## Notes: A sparkle and a name on the herb, vein, chest or quest object you are coming up to: twelve effects, a look for each kind of thing. A wisp carries what you loot into your bag. Works best with the interact key or a gamepad. Needs Patchwerk Forever. Type /sparkle.
